A structure on<ref name="Vader 35" /> the [[planet]]<ref name="Ringo Vinda">{{Databank|ringo-vinda|Ringo Vinda}}</ref> [[Ringo Vinda]] was the '''headquarters''' of the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] [[scientist]] [[Istan Zaly]]. At one point, the rogue [[archaeologist]] [[Doctor]] [[Chelli Lona Aphra]] traveled to the headquarters, though she did not make it far into the structure, and later claimed she did know how lethal the traps within it were, and that at the [[time]] she did not have the incentive to find out.<ref name="Vader 35" /> Between [[3 ABY]] and [[4 ABY]],<ref name="Date">The events of [[Darth Vader (2020) 35|''Darth Vader'' (2020) 35]] take place after the [[Escape from Cloud City]] and before the [[Rescue of Han Solo]], which are dated to [[3 ABY]] and [[4 ABY]], respectively, by ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''.</ref> the [[Dark Lord of the Sith|Sith Lord]] [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] traveled to the headquarters with Aphra and the [[Sith assassin]] [[Ochi]], and he acquired the [[Zaly Shield]]. Whilst at the headquarters, the three were [[Battle with the droid uprising|confronted]] by the [[Droid Crush Pirates of Bestoon]] and the [[droid]] [[G-90|Gee-Ninety]], who sought revenge on Vader.<ref name="Vader 35" />

